                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While a little wobbly, \"Jolly Rover\" was made by someone talented. It's a decent-to-good point and click adventure game; the hint system helps the sporadic spotty puzzle. The biggest problem \"Jolly Rover\" has is the debt it owes \"Monkey Island\"; even as it tries to step out of its shadow, you can tell it's enamoured of it. While it's hardly essential, I played it all the way through.",
